Package: hydroEvents
Title: Extract Event Statistics in Hydrologic Time Series
Version: 0.13.0
Authors@R: c(person("Conrad", "Wasko", email = "conrad.wasko@gmail.com", 
    role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Danlu", "Guo",  role = c("aut")),
    person("Mohammad Masoud", "Mohammadpour Khoie",  role = c("ctb")))
Description: Events from individual hydrologic time series are extracted, and 
events from multiple time series can be matched to each other.

  Wasko, C. & Guo, D. (2022) Understanding event runoff coefficient variability 
  across Australia using the hydroEvents R package. 
  Hydrological Processes <doi:10.1002/hyp.14563>.
  Mohammadpour Khoie, M. M., Guo, D. & Wasko, C. (2025) Improving the 
  consistency of hydrologic event identification. Environmental Modelling and 
  Software. <doi:10.1016/j.envsoft.2025.106521>.
  
